###----------------------------------------###
###
### When set to YES it will run Ægir Master
### Instance install/upgrade with -d option,
### displaying complete Drush backend report.
###
### _DEBUG_MODE=YES
###
_DEBUG_MODE=NO


###----------------------------------------###
### AEGIR PACKAGES DOWNLOAD MODE           ###
###----------------------------------------###
###
### _DL_MODE=BATCH (default, multi-download)
### _DL_MODE=GIT   (src from GIT repositories)
### _DL_MODE=OLD   (legacy, static mode)
###
