###----------------------------------------###
### DB SERVER                              ###
###----------------------------------------###
###
### Percona or MySQL (from Trixie).
###
_DB_SERVER=Percona


###----------------------------------------###
### DB SERIES                              ###
###----------------------------------------###
###
### Supported values:
###
### 5.7 (Percona)
